  "Method status: reviewed = the body the driver was written against; token-renumbered = same instructions as the reviewed 5.8.1 body once metadata tokens are resolved to names (new token, new raw IL hash); changed = the body really differs and is NOT accepted as the reviewed body; changed-reviewed = the body really differs, its new body was reviewed against the driver plan ('review') and is accepted for that version only (the 5.8.1 pins are unchanged). added-reviewed = a method of a later release only (absent from the default oracle, e.g. U5 3.1.0 CnkdHkd01TT50Nckt310 of 5.8.2; the pbt-582-* pins of the 05-1/PBT-KK-TNCN import plan, cases run on 5.8.2 only), pinned as itself with its review for that version only.",
